    {
      "section": 0,
      "rect": {
        "x": 967,
        "y": 503,
        "w": 638,
        "h": 100
      },
      "type": "text",
      "tag": "p",
      "level": null,
      "text": "Macbeth: Seeds of Fate is an interactive 3D adventure in which players will need to explore the environment to solve puzzles to unravel the story of Macbeth.",
      "links": [],
      "style": {
        "font": "prompt, sans-serif",
        "size": "20px",
        "weight": "400",
        "color": "rgb(255, 255, 255)",
        "align": "start",
        "lineHeight": "33.4px",
        "letterSpacing": "normal",
        "transform": "none",
        "italic": false
      }
    },
    {
      "section": 0,
      "rect": {
        "x": 967,
        "y": 603,
        "w": 638,
        "h": 120
      },
      "type": "text",
      "tag": "p",
      "level": null,
      "text": "In this game, you will incarnate Shakespeare, who, with the help of some supernatural powers, must travel between two realities to discover and write the incredible play Macbeth.",
      "links": [],
      "style": {
        "font": "prompt, sans-serif",
        "size": "20px",
        "weight": "400",
        "color": "rgb(255, 255, 255)",
        "align": "start",
        "lineHeight": "normal",
        "letterSpacing": "normal",
        "transform": "none",
        "italic": false
      }
    },
    {
      "section": 0,
      "rect": {
        "x": 967,
        "y": 819,
        "w": 638,
        "h": 67
      },
      "type": "text",
      "tag": "p",
      "level": null,
      "text": "I worked as Game Designer and Technical designer on this game in Divertifica",
      "links": [],
      "style": {
        "font": "prompt, sans-serif",
        "size": "20px",
        "weight": "400",
        "color": "rgb(255, 255, 255)",
        "align": "start",
        "lineHeight": "33.4px",
        "letterSpacing": "normal",
        "transform": "none",
        "italic": false
      }
    },
    {
      "section": 1,
      "rect": {
        "x": -51,
        "y": 934,
        "w": 370,
        "h": 48
      },
      "type": "heading",
      "tag": "h1",
      "level": 1,
      "text": "About this game:",
      "links": [],
      "style": {
        "font": "prompt, sans-serif",
        "size": "40px",
        "weight": "400",
        "color": "rgb(255, 255, 255)",
        "align": "start",
        "lineHeight": "48px",
        "letterSpacing": "normal",
        "transform": "none",
        "italic": false
      }
    },
    {
      "section": 1,
      "rect": {
        "x": -51,
        "y": 1006,
        "w": 938,
        "h": 63
      },
      "type": "text",
      "tag": "p",
      "level": null,
      "text": "This game has been canceled, but is playable in Itch.io. What you see in the video is the vertical slice we created for funding purposes.",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "Itch.io",
          "href": "https://divertifica.itch.io/macbeth-seeds-of-fate"
        }
      ],
      "style": {
        "font": "prompt, sans-serif",
        "size": "18px",
        "weight": "400",
        "color": "rgb(255, 255, 255)",
        "align": "start",
        "lineHeight": "31.5px",
        "letterSpacing": "normal",
        "transform": "none",
        "italic": false
      }
    },
    {
      "section": 1,
      "rect": {
        "x": -51,
        "y": 1100,
        "w": 938,
        "h": 63
      },
      "type": "text",
      "tag": "p",
      "level": null,
      "text": "The game was initially conceived as a 2D minigame-based experience. You can see the trailer for that version on the right. However, we later shifted our focus toward a more ambitious storytelling approach.",
      "links": [],
      "style": {
        "font": "prompt, sans-serif",
        "size": "18px",
        "weight": "400",
        "color": "rgb(255, 255, 255)",
        "align": "start",
        "lineHeight": "31.5px",
        "letterSpacing": "normal",
        "transform": "none",
        "italic": false
      }
    },
    {
      "section": 1,
      "rect": {
        "x": -51,
        "y": 1195,
        "w": 938,
        "h": 63
      },
      "type": "text",
      "tag": "p",
      "level": null,
      "text": "The new concept was that the player would control Shakespeare, who, guided by the three Moirai (Fates), is led to an ancient castle where the events of the play took place.",
      "links": [],
      "style": {
        "font": "prompt, sans-serif",
        "size": "18px",
        "weight": "400",
        "color": "rgb(255, 255, 255)",
        "align": "start",
        "lineHeight": "31.5px",
        "letterSpacing": "normal",
        "transform": "none",
        "italic": false
      }
    },
    {
      "section": 1,
      "rect": {
        "x": -51,
        "y": 1289,
        "w": 938,
        "h": 63
      },
      "type": "text",
      "tag": "p",
      "level": null,
      "text": "With the ability to travel between the past and the present, the player would have to solve puzzles and unravel the story that Shakespeare would eventually write.",
      "links": [],
      "style": {
        "font": "prompt, sans-serif",
        "size": "18px",
        "weight": "400",
        "color": "rgb(255, 255, 255)",
        "align": "start",
        "lineHeight": "31.5px",
        "letterSpacing": "normal",
        "transform": "none",
        "italic": false
      }
    },
